# Commit messages (versioning)

Use Conventional Commit style: `<type>[:! ]<summary>`.

- `feat:` ⇒ minor bump
- `fix:` ⇒ patch bump
- `feat!:` / `fix!:` or footer `BREAKING CHANGE:` ⇒ major bump
- Prefer: `chore:`, `ci:`, `build:`, `test:`, `docs:` for non-bump work

No filler. One clear intent per commit.
